%% assets/print-flow.mmd
sequenceDiagram
  participant Homepage
  participant PrintWorker
  participant CUPS as print-vm (CUPS)
  participant Digitus
  participant HP as HP_OfficeJet_4558

  Homepage->>PrintWorker: PDF per HTTP POST /dropzone
  PrintWorker->>CUPS: lp -d PRINTER file.pdf
  CUPS->>Digitus: socket://digitus:9100 (raw/JetDirect)
  Digitus->>HP: USB → Druck
  CUPS-->>PrintWorker: Jobstatus (completed/failed)
